- `branch(b3, AND)` with `precedence(n5, b3)`, `precedence(b3, n6)`, `precedence(b3, n12)`: Introduces parallel execution after shipping, contradicting the strictly sequential source chronology ("followed by...", "At this point..."), violating SMC3/SMC4.
