- `action(n11, "communicate shipment problems second time")` and `action(n12, "communicate shipment problems before shipment")`: Lack outgoing `precedence` links, creating dead-end paths that never reach `end(e1)`, contrary to the source stating "the process comes to an end", violating SMC1/SMC5.
